{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/8lxp63ihngnhobud2pcddln77cety0d.mp3","text":"有，有什么我可以帮忙的事情吗？直接吩咐我就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/3yj7n815s344sol3kvn3qnm7bjvprco.mp3","text":"芙兰卡前辈和雷蛇前辈，都是我憧憬的对象，我也想成为像她们那样优秀的人......我会更加努力的！博士，您会帮我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0b/9g4m7sb272x5ovzzmgk08g81i9yr4bc.mp3","text":"那个，听说香草也在这里？她来黑钢实习的时候在我的小队里，我们一起行动过，如今她也成为可靠的队友了，我却还没有......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/cvzl8fbf34ldsig92otm9c0ht6s8f5q.mp3","text":"博士，我是不是看起来没有什么威严呢？其实我也有自觉的，也想要做出改变......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/pnv6e372w5n6i0ab5hwxbqyzshw8u5s.mp3","text":"有的时候觉得自己还在黑钢，明明已经在罗德岛经历了这么多事情，我也不是过去的我了，真奇怪......是我太想念以前的日子了吗？但是我可一点都不想念过去的自己。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/92/ewokccbkm0jb76vpu1s2lven57m3mu2.mp3","text":"没有成果的话，努力的过程就没有意义，至少我是这么想的。所以我不想被人看见我独自训练的样子。但有博士陪在身边，我又觉得很安心......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/6ed39aonxileyboj3esck404l6tfkh1.mp3","text":"前几天训练时不小心拉伤了肌肉，没关系的请不、不要担心！嘶......我不会给您和罗德岛的大家添麻烦的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/17/s7a4c56qzd51ac8jegd4uy1v8ugl28y.mp3","text":"站住别动，举起手来！......呃，吓到您了吗，芙兰卡前辈告诉我说话要有底气，我只是想尝试一下，对不起......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/i9ink5lkyrn2kxsw6g2zg978o2q0cq6.mp3","text":"不论是在黑钢还是在罗德岛，优秀的人都太多了，我很清楚自己的实力与前辈们之间的差距......不过如果您偶尔夸奖我一下，我还是会开心的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/esuqib58kd2khb2p17kpfl4wlwwvk2e.mp3","text":"博士，博士？睡着了吗？我帮您把办公桌收拾一下哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f7/qf43fs64xjynyw421k9mvh0zxdmdhgt.mp3","text":"请问是博士吗......您好，我是黑钢国际的杰西卡，我，我不太擅长自我介绍，呜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/1u6c7pij9403pzpaiy6nb7246lqbt47.mp3","text":"这样好像要比独自训练的收获更多一些？","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/s7454wr8wn58wavbmulr6w87qgoludp.mp3","text":"得到您的认可我、我有点开心，我稍微哭一下，就一下，呜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/sxc8mr0pq5gc9ndei22dmem2yk9ibc8.mp3","text":"啊，博士，我已经成为优秀的干员了吗？谢谢您一直以来都陪在我身边，正因为这样，我才能坚持下来......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/g1uqn11vnrm3ma4g43ckoq7uv9393r2.mp3","text":"请下指令，我会好好执行！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/t0a5ie40p40esvxr9s43decmfc701jk.mp3","text":"我一定......不会辜负您的信任。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/564t6rqlhp3v7rnxbmbxkczd0bsh05q.mp3","text":"集中精神......直视前方。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/8rcjqdkrlq5qlybx9yexk3mxs8vigbt.mp3","text":"这次我要证明自己......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f6/2idxopxsp3s007ahxwga2jctds36b0i.mp3","text":"待命中......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/a8tw7l04z49kt434m2gybwxvlqo94p2.mp3","text":"呜哇？！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/gjnae12n2lfb7wvmpif3o3lzl87yvsd.mp3","text":"呼......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/40/kzyg7z9x0w0t0a1l5b4vap81hwj1yav.mp3","text":"好了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/rj4vt2mzc1kvpl4ae6u28r8u7rpl8f1.mp3","text":"不可原谅......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/b74bvayjgjuv1x4bvjp9jblxh403dlt.mp3","text":"站住别动！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/1a/erjbqgb6wnhhuvi4fqhjlgto1f6a0ss.mp3","text":"不会退缩。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/h0xn6viu5cneljnb45snzavfj3m59am.mp3","text":"我可不会手下留情！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/09wy2slmo5fjhxw2wvzefq5rx0oui1g.mp3","text":"山顶才是我的目标......可不能允许自己止步于山腰。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/3veqaemd3szsij78ewwcgzpf80yhajk.mp3","text":"我做到了......？我用自己的力量保护了大家吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dc/5kmfl9dkwj1n71fdos5um112yfl2778.mp3","text":"这还不是最好的结果，不能因为这样的胜利而骄傲懈怠......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/fs281qftvcfx8spc1eoa8e7by45per1.mp3","text":"请求医疗支援！都是我拖累了大家......对不起、对不起、对不起！","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/p95seubzz8nhwbud3vozn31r4j8kgf9.mp3","text":"罗德岛的大家好相处吗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/59n32gca62dw40bejeyk1pud5kzdh8r.mp3","text":"要去哪里......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/b3beh4lhrgi32zdf4nujgonkwj5h3ix.mp3","text":"料理的话我也是会做的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/febdfkkntzen8pzku24fjlgs6g2gwuf.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/9spt998dixscoyrxl9esl0l4jn7w4mo.mp3","text":"呃——对、对不起，博士，我似乎有点训练过头了，手一直在发抖......但我自己就可以把这些气球挂上去的，没问题的！......好了，博士，新年快乐。","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f2/41bl3uq6lgxfco15lk00z3pegnrqofd.mp3","text":"早上好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_235_jesica/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/82ybil0ua8gh5c2ftfdepgvgn9vukue.mp3","text":"有，有什么我可以帮忙的事情吗？直接吩咐我就好了。","alt":"voice/char_235_jesica/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/e8dmmx3jqggrbxtmajwah16ppab7jty.mp3","text":"芙兰卡前辈和雷蛇前辈，都是我憧憬的对象，我也想成为像她们那样优秀的人......我会更加努力的！博士，您会帮我吗？","alt":"voice/char_235_jesica/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/g5jd60z2m7wl060b7xela803chuls7c.mp3","text":"那个，听说香草也在这里？她来黑钢实习的时候在我的小队里，我们一起行动过，如今她也成为可靠的队友了，我却还没有......","alt":"voice/char_235_jesica/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e1/q9qhk8xeo6k9xti1oyiqavgkdptrnlt.mp3","text":"博士，我是不是看起来没有什么威严呢？其实我也有自觉的，也想要做出改变......","alt":"voice/char_235_jesica/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6d/lcv1vj9khjdgrw5c7iiamao009u7xc5.mp3","text":"有的时候觉得自己还在黑钢，明明已经在罗德岛经历了这么多事情，我也不是过去的我了，真奇怪.